## Whole-room frontier responsibility

`next-frontier-readonly/README.md` pins the current integration source trace.
The Access selector proves confirmation's first work face. Sites opens and
settles only the caller-selected Site/operation; the phase companion refresh
preserves existing endpoints and paths. No current runtime owner selects the
next reachable Site or publishes the next supported station/route. The host
must sequence current BRACE/CUT/FINISH operations, genuine worker movement,
materials, output and settlement across the actual Room's full claimed cube
set. The present one-cube positive does not establish whole Kitchen completion.

No broader full-suite, production Profile renewal, whole-World retirement,
native memory, whole-room progression or playable-delivery claim is made.
